---
title: Sign — Welcome — Things 4 Good
permalink: /print/welcome/
---
{% extends "print.njk" %}

{#- For the front door during the sale: big enough to read from the walk. Eight of Mazie's labels
    along the bottom, in the order of candles.json. -#}

{% block style %}
  .body { justify-content: space-evenly; padding: 0.1in 0; }
  .hello { text-align: center; }
  .hello .hand { display: block; font-size: 130pt; line-height: .9; color: var(--marigold-d); }
  .hello p { margin-top: 0.08in; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 26pt; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .lines { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.18in; }
  .line { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.95in 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 0.26in; padding: 0.2in 0.3in 0.2in 0.22in; border-radius: 18px; background: var(--c-t); }
  .line .n { width: 0.95in; height: 0.95in; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--c); color: #fff; display: grid; place-items: center; font-family: var(--hand); font-weight: 700; font-size: 44pt; line-height: 1; }
  .line h2 { font-size: 40pt; line-height: 1; }
  .line p { margin-top: 6px; font-size: 15pt; line-height: 1.3; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .labels { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 0.12in; }
  .labels div { height: 1.02in; background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 6px; }
  .labels img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; }
  /* Printed, the biggest pieces scale with the page height (100vh is the page area in print), so a
     browser that prints with wider margins than ours still gets the whole sign on one page. */
  @media print {
    .hello .hand { font-size: min(130pt, 17vh); }
    .line { padding-top: min(0.2in, 1.9vh); padding-bottom: min(0.2in, 1.9vh); }
    .line .n { width: min(0.95in, 9.2vh); height: min(0.95in, 9.2vh); }
    .line h2 { font-size: min(40pt, 5.4vh); }
    .labels div { height: min(1.02in, 9.6vh); }
  }
  .cap { margin-top: 0.08in; text-align: center; font-size: 17pt; color: var(--pine-d); }
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<div class="body">
  <div class="hello">
    <span class="hand">Welcome!</span>
    <p>We&rsquo;re so glad you&rsquo;re here.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="lines">
    <div class="line" style="--c:var(--marigold);--c-t:var(--marigold-t)"><span class="n">1</span><div><h2>Come on in.</h2><p>No need to knock.</p></div></div>
    <div class="line" style="--c:var(--pine);--c-t:var(--pine-t)"><span class="n">2</span><div><h2>Leave your shoes on.</h2><p>Really, it&rsquo;s fine.</p></div></div>
    <div class="line" style="--c:var(--berry);--c-t:var(--berry-t)"><span class="n">3</span><div><h2>Check out the candles.</h2><p>{{ candles.scents | length }} scents. Every candle is a ${{ site.pricePerCandle }} donation to this year&rsquo;s four causes.</p></div></div>
  </div>
  <div>
    <div class="labels">
      {% for scent in candles.scents %}{% if loop.index <= 8 and scent.art %}<div><img src="{{ scent.art }}" alt="" /></div>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="cap hand">Every label drawn by Mazie.</p>
  </div>
</div>
{% endblock %}
